WEBVTT

00:46.254 --> 00:48.423
Are you finished yet? Where is Yeon-su?

00:48.506 --> 00:51.551
Oh, we didn't know it would
suddenly rain so much here today.

00:51.634 --> 00:53.720
So, so I was getting this.

00:53.803 --> 00:55.847
So Ms. Kook is still on standby too.

00:55.930 --> 00:56.973
Oh, right.

00:57.640 --> 01:00.018
I think we should just call it a day.
It's pouring really bad.

01:00.101 --> 01:03.938
All right. I'll go get Ms. Kook then.
She probably doesn't have an umbrella.

01:04.981 --> 01:06.191
No, I'll go.

01:10.028 --> 01:11.112
What?

01:12.322 --> 01:14.574
Did you only decide
to work on this project

01:16.117 --> 01:18.078
because Ms. Kook would be here too?

01:29.422 --> 01:31.341
Um, where is she? Tell me.

01:31.424 --> 01:33.718
Why is it raining so much today?

01:35.095 --> 01:37.472
I hate it when things
don't go according to plan.

01:37.555 --> 01:39.808
I wonder where we should shoot the rest.

01:46.606 --> 01:48.525
Anything out of my control,

01:50.276 --> 01:51.945
I treat it as a risk factor.

01:54.989 --> 01:56.074
Back then and even now,

01:57.242 --> 01:58.910
Yeon-su is someone like that to me.

02:01.037 --> 02:02.747
The first time I saw Yeon-su…

02:06.084 --> 02:08.545
Never mind, it's not that important.

02:16.010 --> 02:17.929
It doesn't matter who liked her first.

02:20.473 --> 02:23.560
I ended up becoming the jerk
who liked his friend's girlfriend.

02:26.229 --> 02:29.399
Because of that,
I had to keep making plans instead…

02:36.281 --> 02:39.325
Plans to not cross the line, ever.

02:48.543 --> 02:51.754
Hey, Yeon-su and I are going to eat
at our restaurant. Join us.

02:52.630 --> 02:54.674
And I didn't want
to become somebody

02:54.757 --> 02:57.302
who would teeter between
friendship and love like a kid.

02:57.385 --> 02:58.303
I'm busy.

02:58.386 --> 03:01.097
What do you mean you're busy?
You're reading a comic book.

03:01.181 --> 03:03.183
Well, I just finished and now…

03:03.266 --> 03:04.434
I have homework.

03:05.768 --> 03:09.189
Hey, I know that
Yeon-su is kind of weird, but…

03:09.272 --> 03:11.900
you're being too obvious
about hating her, okay?

03:11.983 --> 03:13.234
She's my girlfriend.

03:13.318 --> 03:14.861
It's nothing like that.

03:14.944 --> 03:16.946
But why do I feel like
you're actively avoiding her?

03:17.030 --> 03:18.281
Come on, that's crazy.

03:18.364 --> 03:20.617
Just stop the nonsense and go already.

03:20.700 --> 03:23.328
- She'll yell at you. Get out of here.
- Hm.

03:24.120 --> 03:26.539
When I first realized it,
it was really hard for me.

03:26.623 --> 03:28.208
- Fine, see you--
- By the way,

03:28.291 --> 03:30.084
you're a lot weirder than she is.

03:34.839 --> 03:37.926
But then,
I got used to it after a while.

03:40.803 --> 03:42.222
My plans were simple.

03:46.851 --> 03:48.436
Oh, Ji-ung, can you give me a ride…

03:50.188 --> 03:52.440
Don't get involved
in any encounters.

03:52.523 --> 03:53.566
Oh, darn it.

03:59.280 --> 04:00.823
Yeon-su and I broke up.

04:05.662 --> 04:07.455
Don't get fooled
by words like that.

04:11.209 --> 04:13.044
Just go and apologize.

04:13.127 --> 04:15.797
Oh, yeah, have you tried
that new teokbokki place?

04:15.880 --> 04:17.173
- It seems good.
- Okay. I'm hungry.

04:17.257 --> 04:18.925
I tried meeting new people.

04:19.008 --> 04:20.760
- I see. Cool.
- Let's go try it?

04:29.018 --> 04:31.938
This time,
it looks like it's over for real.

04:43.616 --> 04:45.618
KOOK YEON-SU

04:45.702 --> 04:47.078
DELETE, SYNC CONTACT, SHARE CONTACT

04:50.039 --> 04:53.584
And whatever happens,
don't you ever dare waver.

04:55.086 --> 04:56.170
Yeon-su!

04:56.963 --> 04:58.381
- And…
- Oh, hey!

05:03.970 --> 05:05.972
…you have to slowly forget her.

05:10.268 --> 05:14.188
But then, just when I had thought
my plans had succeeded…

05:14.939 --> 05:17.317
How have you been doing, Kim Ji-ung?

05:18.693 --> 05:20.653
…Yeon-su is
standing in front of me again.

05:26.159 --> 05:27.869
Like a risk factor out of my control.

05:29.287 --> 05:30.496
Just like now.

05:33.041 --> 05:34.208
But then…

05:35.251 --> 05:37.670
now I actually find myself thinking,

05:38.254 --> 05:40.214
if things don't go
according to plan again,

05:41.549 --> 05:45.261
do I really need plans now?
Or do I just let it be?

05:45.345 --> 05:48.723
EPISODE 9
JUST FRIENDS

08:51.364 --> 08:54.158
Ung! I called you so many times!

08:55.368 --> 08:56.577
Are you still sleeping?

08:59.288 --> 09:00.289
Ung.

09:01.123 --> 09:02.250
Ung?

09:05.169 --> 09:06.420
Hey, are you okay?

09:09.382 --> 09:10.675
Oh, gosh.

09:10.758 --> 09:12.510
Hey. Get up.

09:12.593 --> 09:14.345
Dude, you're burning up!

09:14.428 --> 09:15.680
Are you okay?

09:39.537 --> 09:41.581
BEST PROPOSAL
CULTURE-COMPLEX, BEAUTY, FASHION

09:41.664 --> 09:43.416
Thanks to our past projects,

09:43.499 --> 09:47.211
we have a lot of marketing requests
for cultural-complex centers.

09:48.504 --> 09:50.965
The ones we can work on now involve us…

09:52.383 --> 09:54.010
Ms. Kook?

09:56.137 --> 09:57.805
Ms. Kook!

09:59.015 --> 10:00.266
Oh, right.

10:01.392 --> 10:03.352
Are you feeling okay?

10:03.436 --> 10:05.271
Are you really not feeling well today?

10:05.354 --> 10:07.481
You look a bit pale, to be honest.

10:07.565 --> 10:09.191
You should have gotten
more rest, you know.

10:09.275 --> 10:10.735
Are you really okay?

10:10.818 --> 10:13.654
I'm really sorry.
Can we take a short break?

10:14.822 --> 10:15.906
Okay.

10:20.286 --> 10:22.663
She's been acting like that for days.

10:22.747 --> 10:23.873
It's been five days.

10:24.540 --> 10:28.002
She's been out of it ever since
she came back from her leave a week ago.

10:28.085 --> 10:29.712
Do you think something happened to her?

10:32.923 --> 10:35.176
What's going on with me?

10:47.813 --> 10:49.857
This is going way to far already.

10:57.490 --> 10:58.574
SOL-I

11:03.829 --> 11:04.997
- Yeah?
- "Yeah"?

11:05.081 --> 11:07.208
What is this? You answered right away.

11:07.792 --> 11:09.085
Hey, what's up?

11:09.168 --> 11:10.544
I want you to come over after work.

11:10.628 --> 11:11.879
I have a new menu prepared.

11:11.962 --> 11:13.798
Next time. I'm busy.

11:13.881 --> 11:16.926
You're busy again?
You just finished your last project.

11:17.009 --> 11:18.469
I need to test out my menu.

11:18.552 --> 11:20.054
Just call someone else.

11:23.683 --> 11:26.435
Why don't you try calling Gu Eun-ho?

11:27.061 --> 11:28.229
He's trying it right now.

11:28.854 --> 11:31.065
But then he's saying
that everything's bad.

11:31.148 --> 11:32.650
I don't think I can trust him.

11:32.733 --> 11:33.818
What?

11:33.901 --> 11:35.861
He's at your place? He's not at work?

11:35.945 --> 11:37.113
He has time off?

11:37.780 --> 11:40.324
- Hey, are you free?
- Hmm.

11:40.408 --> 11:42.618
Why are you always free?
Don't you have work?

11:45.955 --> 11:48.082
That settles it. He's unemployed.

11:48.165 --> 11:50.626
He's resting
since Ung's taking a break.

11:50.710 --> 11:51.919
What does that mean?

11:52.002 --> 11:54.714
Anyway, just come over later.
Stop acting busy.

12:00.344 --> 12:03.681
I can't help but wonder
what Ung is thinking about now.

13:12.917 --> 13:14.585
How long have I been like this?

13:33.562 --> 13:34.647
Hey, Mom.

13:54.208 --> 13:55.960
Mom?

13:56.043 --> 13:57.169
Oh, you're up.

13:57.253 --> 14:00.089
Come over here.
Let me see if your fever broke.

14:06.470 --> 14:08.597
Oh. Your fever's all gone.

14:09.181 --> 14:12.685
Sometimes you get a bad fever
whenever you caught a cold.

14:13.602 --> 14:16.564
Are you still taking the meds
I sent over to you last time?

14:16.647 --> 14:18.399
- Hmm.
- Mm-hm.

14:18.482 --> 14:20.317
You only took a few and stopped, huh?

14:20.401 --> 14:23.487
I heard you got drenched in the rain
during your trip for the shoot.

14:25.322 --> 14:27.658
One of these days
I'm gonna get rid of Eun-ho.

14:34.874 --> 14:36.375
But what are you doing here, Mom?

14:36.458 --> 14:39.712
You know, I think it's the first time
I've seen your drawings

14:39.795 --> 14:41.714
up close like this.

14:42.882 --> 14:45.384
You left early last time
without looking at it.

14:49.680 --> 14:53.976
When did my little boy
grow up so much? You're all grown up.

14:55.394 --> 14:56.437
Wait, what?

14:57.855 --> 15:00.149
Mom, I've been a grown man for a while.

15:04.528 --> 15:06.989
Why did you grow up all alone?

15:09.283 --> 15:11.660
Did you have a hard time so far?

15:13.454 --> 15:16.540
You shouldn't have to carry
the load all on your own.

15:16.624 --> 15:19.376
You really don't.

15:20.252 --> 15:23.505
Well, then I guess Mom and Dad

15:23.589 --> 15:26.175
aren't those you can always depend on.

15:26.759 --> 15:28.719
It's not that, don't worry, Mom.

15:29.470 --> 15:31.931
I'm just comfortable spending time alone.

15:32.932 --> 15:35.643
Ung, but still…

15:35.726 --> 15:38.437
It's okay. I like how I am.

15:42.483 --> 15:44.818
It's okay
to be alone for a long time.

15:44.902 --> 15:46.195
You get used to it.

15:48.030 --> 15:49.865
But I never want to be alone again

15:51.450 --> 15:53.410
after losing someone important.

16:05.798 --> 16:08.175
We just had instant noodles
for lunch the first day.

16:08.258 --> 16:11.261
And then later we grilled up some meat
and even made stew for dinner.

16:11.345 --> 16:13.347
One of them was a really good cook too.

16:14.014 --> 16:15.349
And then on the next day…

16:16.767 --> 16:18.894
Uh… what did we have again?

16:20.187 --> 16:23.107
Oh, the cast slept in, so the rest of us
went out to eat that morning.

16:23.190 --> 16:24.274
And then later on for lunch--

16:24.358 --> 16:27.903
Hey, I wasn't asking what you ate there.
You got it?

16:27.987 --> 16:29.113
Oh.

16:30.864 --> 16:33.117
Ji-ung was the one
who filmed Ms. Kook on the first day,

16:33.200 --> 16:35.411
and Chae-ran handled filmed for Mr. Choi.

16:35.494 --> 16:37.538
Meanwhile, I stayed back
and set up the lights.

16:37.621 --> 16:39.748
And then we filmed at the house
in the evening too.

16:39.832 --> 16:41.333
- And then the next--
- No, not that.

16:41.417 --> 16:44.420
Tell me, di… didn't
anything interesting happen?

16:45.921 --> 16:48.674
Oh, right.
The casts' friends were really fun.

16:48.757 --> 16:51.468
During the shoot,
they showed me all around the village.

16:53.095 --> 16:55.222
Hey. Go.

16:55.305 --> 16:56.515
Go on, drink.

16:56.598 --> 16:57.766
Shut up and drink.

16:59.184 --> 17:00.894
Jeez.

17:04.356 --> 17:06.442
Oh, right.

17:07.026 --> 17:08.777
There was a lot of rain
on one of the days,

17:08.861 --> 17:11.238
so we were kind of forced
to stop filming that day.

17:11.989 --> 17:12.823
And?

17:12.906 --> 17:15.117
Chae-ran was filming
with Ms. Kook during that time,

17:15.200 --> 17:17.286
but she came back alone.

17:17.369 --> 17:20.330
And then Ji-ung arrived
with Ms. Kook a little while later.

17:21.123 --> 17:23.625
And then Mr. Choi
was gone for a long time too,

17:23.709 --> 17:25.961
but then he came back soaking wet after.

17:26.795 --> 17:28.088
Really?

17:28.172 --> 17:30.340
Oh… Then what?

17:30.424 --> 17:32.468
And so we canceled the shoot.

17:32.551 --> 17:34.261
We were going to film more the next day,

17:34.344 --> 17:37.264
but we couldn't because the cast went
to Seoul instead early in the morning.

17:37.347 --> 17:38.474
Oh…

17:39.892 --> 17:41.977
Then why didn't you tell me earlier?

17:42.061 --> 17:44.730
You should have told me
when I asked if anything happened then!

17:46.899 --> 17:49.777
But then, why did the cast leave early?

17:49.860 --> 17:52.946
Well, they said there was
something urgent they had to do.

17:53.489 --> 17:55.616
But it was kind of… how do I say…

17:55.699 --> 17:57.910
It did seem like something was going on.

17:57.993 --> 18:00.037
The cast could have fought, maybe.

18:00.120 --> 18:03.373
No. But it seemed like something
different was going on with them.

18:04.083 --> 18:05.709
But what's even more strange

18:05.793 --> 18:08.378
was that Ji-ung and Chae-ran
were acting weird too.

18:08.462 --> 18:09.922
They were quiet.

18:10.005 --> 18:12.341
- Why?
- Uh, why? Well…

18:12.424 --> 18:14.760
I'm not really sure why they were.

18:14.843 --> 18:19.223
But they were talking outside
for a long time and late at night too.

18:19.306 --> 18:22.142
Really? Private?

18:22.935 --> 18:25.896
Oh, really? Well, is that so?

18:45.958 --> 18:47.876
Ji-ung,
I ordered you some dinner.

18:48.710 --> 18:49.753
Come and eat it later.

19:01.557 --> 19:02.766
Did you get off work?

19:05.602 --> 19:06.979
Have you eaten dinner?

19:13.318 --> 19:14.987
Did you rest…

19:18.657 --> 19:20.159
I want to make it seem like

19:21.493 --> 19:22.911
nothing's going on, but…

19:39.636 --> 19:42.014
KIM JI-UNG

19:56.778 --> 19:58.739
Where are you?
Text me the address.

19:58.822 --> 20:00.240
Are you coming for me?

20:00.324 --> 20:02.784
I can find you easily.
Delete it while I'm asking nicely.

20:02.868 --> 20:04.494
I'm the one who decides.

20:04.578 --> 20:07.748
Only if you're still alive then.
Delete it.

20:07.831 --> 20:09.958
You make that face all the time anyway.

20:10.042 --> 20:11.251
That's your limit.

20:12.753 --> 20:14.630
That's the limit
of the producer.

20:17.424 --> 20:20.010
LEEZAKAYA

20:20.802 --> 20:22.930
All right, I'll delete it.

20:23.013 --> 20:24.181
Did you have dinner yet?

20:51.250 --> 20:52.292
WITH UNG

20:53.168 --> 20:54.836
- Oh, you're back.
- Hey.

20:54.920 --> 20:56.672
How is he? Has his fever gone down?

20:56.755 --> 20:58.173
Yes.

20:58.257 --> 21:01.635
His fever's down,
and I gave him some food.

21:06.431 --> 21:08.475
- But why do you look so down?
- What?

21:08.558 --> 21:11.687
- Is he still not feeling that well yet?
- It's not that.

21:11.770 --> 21:13.814
I looked around his studio,

21:14.356 --> 21:16.608
and he had a lot more pills than before.

21:16.692 --> 21:18.568
He still seems to have trouble sleeping.

21:19.486 --> 21:21.655
He must be spending
all of his time in there.

21:22.364 --> 21:25.284
And when I went
and looked around his room.

21:25.367 --> 21:28.161
I couldn't help but feel
how lonely it was there.

21:28.245 --> 21:29.913
- Really?
- Hmm.

21:31.540 --> 21:35.669
You think…
that Ung will be okay like this?

21:38.213 --> 21:40.299
You know, he's not like others.

21:40.382 --> 21:43.135
I'm sure that he'll be all right, huh?

21:53.895 --> 21:55.272
UNG'S DRAWINGS ORGANIZED BY EUN-HO

22:42.319 --> 22:43.820
DRAWINGS FROM UNG'S DARK TIMES

22:45.989 --> 22:48.533
I appreciate
your drawing skills, of course,

22:48.617 --> 22:51.286
but I really hope
this period never comes back.

23:32.244 --> 23:34.871
- Did you sleep with him?
- Are you crazy?

23:35.872 --> 23:38.708
So then all you two did was kiss, right?

23:38.792 --> 23:41.378
And you're ruining
my new dish just because of that?

23:41.461 --> 23:42.462
"All we did was kiss"?

23:42.546 --> 23:45.382
Is that why you two ran away
the next day all of a sudden?

23:46.091 --> 23:48.051
Oh! So boring!

23:48.135 --> 23:50.345
Isn't there anything interesting?

23:52.180 --> 23:55.559
Honestly speaking, it's more surprising
that nothing has happened until now.

23:56.143 --> 23:58.895
If the same thing happened with my ex,
it'd be different.

23:58.979 --> 24:02.149
I'd have loads of feelings left,
you know I'd be a sentimental mess,

24:02.232 --> 24:04.818
and then next thing you know,
I'd be drinking and jumping all over him.

24:04.901 --> 24:06.653
I really must be crazy, huh?

24:06.736 --> 24:08.697
To come to your place
and tell you all this.

24:08.780 --> 24:10.866
Hey, now, you two are adults, aren't you?

24:10.949 --> 24:12.826
Plus, you guys have dated before.

24:12.909 --> 24:16.455
Things like that can happen,
especially if the mood is right.

24:16.538 --> 24:18.415
Everyone does that. What's the problem?

24:18.498 --> 24:20.292
But not everyone is like you.

24:20.375 --> 24:22.169
Well, not everyone's like you, either.

24:24.421 --> 24:28.758
Just say, "It was a mistake,"
and then forget about it.

24:28.842 --> 24:30.552
But it's really not that simple.

24:31.178 --> 24:34.473
Listen to yourself, you're just
making things more complicated.

24:35.307 --> 24:38.477
And why in the world are you being
so pouty about this whole thing?

24:38.560 --> 24:39.769
What's the problem?

24:39.853 --> 24:42.272
I mean, he hasn't even bothered
to try and contact me.

24:42.355 --> 24:44.357
Even after he did something like that?

24:45.025 --> 24:47.944
Hey, then what are your fingers for, huh?

24:48.028 --> 24:49.237
Call him up.

24:51.948 --> 24:54.534
Or maybe he's gotten his answer already.

24:54.618 --> 24:58.163
He's decided, "It was a mistake."
Is that what you think?

24:59.039 --> 25:00.707
He's not the type to do that.

25:00.790 --> 25:02.292
What are you on about?

25:02.375 --> 25:04.211
Do you still think he's your boyfriend?

25:04.294 --> 25:06.922
Hey, you don't know him now.

25:07.005 --> 25:08.924
He might seem dim-witted on the outside,

25:09.007 --> 25:11.176
but he's actually much more
thoughtful than I am.

25:11.259 --> 25:14.095
Oh, jeez. Don't you get it?

25:14.179 --> 25:16.890
If he wanted to get back together,
he would have come to you already.

25:16.973 --> 25:18.266
But where is he now…

25:30.529 --> 25:31.530
Do you…

25:35.825 --> 25:37.494
want to get back together? Is that it?

25:45.335 --> 25:47.462
Are you really worried
that he might say that?

25:48.630 --> 25:50.090
It was a mistake?

25:54.261 --> 25:55.637
Or do you still…

26:04.771 --> 26:05.855
Yeon-su.

26:09.150 --> 26:10.443
When did this feeling start?

26:14.573 --> 26:15.865
Was it from the beginning?

26:21.955 --> 26:24.416
Even when I had to return
to this relationship

26:26.543 --> 26:28.295
that I had coldly abandoned…

26:29.921 --> 26:30.880
Who…

26:32.632 --> 26:33.883
…I was so confident.

26:44.894 --> 26:47.063
I just had to avoid any emotions.

26:48.940 --> 26:50.358
How have you been?

26:53.361 --> 26:54.362
Answer me.

26:56.239 --> 26:57.782
How have you been, Yeon-su?

26:59.492 --> 27:01.911
So I just
had to hide my feelings.

27:16.926 --> 27:17.927
But then…

27:23.016 --> 27:24.851
What do I do, Sol-i?

27:28.647 --> 27:30.357
I'm not that sure anymore.

28:16.319 --> 28:18.947
Yes.
I'm eating something disgusting.

28:26.454 --> 28:29.082
Why are you just standing there
with the lights off?

28:32.502 --> 28:34.129
Your room is squeaky clean too.

28:35.338 --> 28:37.382
At least you seem to be cleaning properly.

28:43.555 --> 28:45.598
I'm going to be staying here for a while.

28:47.600 --> 28:48.893
Do whatever you want.

28:48.977 --> 28:50.437
Just like you always did.

29:04.492 --> 29:06.411
I was in such a good mood today.

29:11.416 --> 29:12.333
Please enjoy.

29:12.417 --> 29:13.460
Thank you.

29:14.210 --> 29:15.754
We should come here more often.

29:25.722 --> 29:26.806
Holy shit!

29:28.224 --> 29:29.851
Oh, this is a disaster.

29:38.777 --> 29:40.862
I'm done with thinking.

29:42.906 --> 29:44.657
There's only one conclusion.

30:08.264 --> 30:09.682
Hey! Wait!

30:14.979 --> 30:16.064
Kook Yeon-su.

30:21.152 --> 30:22.320
Wait, are you drunk right now?

30:25.949 --> 30:28.243
- Are you a douchebag?
- What?

30:28.827 --> 30:32.121
You've really changed, haven't you?

30:32.831 --> 30:34.874
I don't care how you've lived so far

30:34.958 --> 30:37.669
or how much freedom you've enjoyed
since the last time we were together,

30:37.752 --> 30:39.462
but were you really going to…

30:40.588 --> 30:43.508
- Going to…
- Do you want some water?

30:48.263 --> 30:50.431
Were you really going
to just stay here and pretend

30:50.515 --> 30:52.976
like nothing happened
after doing all that to me?

30:53.059 --> 30:56.271
Is that what people do now?
Is that what they would do…

30:56.354 --> 30:58.690
Do they just kiss
or hold hands with anyone

30:58.773 --> 30:59.983
and then ghost them?

31:01.025 --> 31:02.277
You don't have to shout, you know.

31:02.360 --> 31:04.487
When did that become the cool thing to do?

31:04.571 --> 31:06.364
That's just being a douchebag.

31:23.882 --> 31:25.049
Are you done yet?

31:36.561 --> 31:39.105
How are you acting
like nothing happened between us?

31:41.983 --> 31:45.945
Do you really have nothing to say,
even though I'm standing right here?

31:49.574 --> 31:50.992
You really don't?

31:53.995 --> 31:55.246
Should I apologize…

31:56.915 --> 31:58.374
say it was a mistake?

31:59.417 --> 32:00.460
What?

32:02.086 --> 32:03.296
Is that what you want?

32:10.720 --> 32:12.013
Because I don't want to.

32:14.807 --> 32:15.850
Then what?

32:16.559 --> 32:18.353
Then what do you want to do now?

32:26.194 --> 32:27.654
I'm not dating you again.

32:32.283 --> 32:35.078
So this is the only conclusion.

32:38.373 --> 32:39.582
Oh.

32:41.918 --> 32:46.297
So you don't want to say that it…
that it was a mistake or apologize to me

32:48.132 --> 32:50.009
or even start dating again.

32:51.844 --> 32:54.764
So you're just telling me
to get lost, is that it?

32:58.226 --> 33:01.270
You should have said so earlier
and not wasted my time.

33:03.564 --> 33:04.899
In spite of all of that…

33:05.858 --> 33:08.403
I've concluded that
I can't live without seeing her.

33:08.486 --> 33:09.570
- Yeon-su.
- Don't call me.

33:09.654 --> 33:12.115
I'm never going to
see you again, you inconsiderate jerk.

33:12.198 --> 33:13.491
Can we still be friends?

33:30.341 --> 33:31.718
Let's be friends instead.

33:34.387 --> 33:35.346
What was that?

33:38.182 --> 33:39.600
You want to be what?

33:40.268 --> 33:41.269
Friends.

33:41.936 --> 33:42.770
Why?

33:44.022 --> 33:46.482
We've never been friends before, have we?

33:54.907 --> 33:56.284
I mean, who knows?

33:56.367 --> 33:59.245
We could be
the best of friends instead, right?

34:00.038 --> 34:01.414
Are you drunk right now?

34:01.497 --> 34:03.332
You're the one who's drunk.

34:03.416 --> 34:04.834
You're not on drugs, are you?

34:04.917 --> 34:07.128
I'm not. I'll take my meds later.

34:10.006 --> 34:12.216
Can you really be friends with me?

34:14.802 --> 34:16.095
Hmm.

34:29.400 --> 34:30.443
Okay.

34:31.861 --> 34:33.237
So let's just be friends, then.

34:35.656 --> 34:37.033
That should be fun, I guess.

34:49.712 --> 34:51.464
Do you have anything else that…

34:54.884 --> 34:56.219
Can I sleep over tonight?

34:57.095 --> 34:58.304
Uh, what?

34:58.387 --> 35:01.307
If we're friends, it's okay, right?

35:30.378 --> 35:32.213
Is this because you're drunk?

35:32.839 --> 35:35.216
I'm doing this because we're friends.

35:35.299 --> 35:37.260
- Hey.
- Where's your blanket?

35:37.343 --> 35:39.929
You're not making a friend
sleep without a blanket, are you?

35:40.012 --> 35:41.097
Kook Yeon-su!

35:41.180 --> 35:43.307
Oh, calm down. You don't have to shout.

35:45.059 --> 35:47.436
As you can see,
I drank a bit more than I could handle,

35:47.520 --> 35:50.565
so I'm really tired now.
Would you mind being a bit more quiet?

35:50.648 --> 35:53.025
Hey, why don't you just
go sleep on the bed then.

35:53.109 --> 35:54.861
I'll be working downstairs anyway.

35:54.944 --> 35:58.114
Don't be ridiculous.
Just treat me like a friend, okay?

35:58.197 --> 36:00.158
And give me a blanket before you go.

36:55.254 --> 36:57.215
What does she think she's doing?

37:00.301 --> 37:01.719
KIM JI-UNG

37:13.439 --> 37:15.233
The person you're calling
is unavailable…

38:44.447 --> 38:45.865
That was enthusiastic.

38:45.948 --> 38:48.242
Hey! What are you still doing in my house?

38:48.326 --> 38:50.202
I took a shower.
Oh, can I borrow your clothes?

38:50.286 --> 38:51.537
I didn't bring anything when I came here.

38:52.121 --> 38:53.664
He… hey, then just go home already.

38:53.748 --> 38:56.042
- Why? Can't I hang out here?
- Why?

38:56.125 --> 38:59.295
Because I want to hang out with my friend.
Got a problem with that?

38:59.378 --> 39:01.547
Hey. Why are you even doing this?

39:01.630 --> 39:02.965
You know I don't have any friends.

39:03.049 --> 39:05.009
So I'm excited
'cause I just got a new friend

39:05.092 --> 39:06.427
for the first time in 29 years.

39:06.510 --> 39:09.805
Oh, yeah, if you decide you want to
stop being friends, let me know, hm?

39:15.728 --> 39:17.772
I'll just take some clothes
from your closet.

39:17.855 --> 39:20.107
Didn't you sleep?
Isn't it time for bed now?

39:20.191 --> 39:21.067
I'm going to sleep.

39:21.150 --> 39:23.527
Go to bed. I'll just hang out here, okay?

39:25.446 --> 39:28.324
I hope you're not here anymore
by the time I wake up later.

39:28.407 --> 39:31.327
I'll be the one to decide that.
Get some sleep.

39:37.041 --> 39:39.001
Jeez, what the hell is wrong
with that woman?

39:42.630 --> 39:43.464
Hmm?

39:46.801 --> 39:48.552
How did she know I hadn't slept yet?

40:06.654 --> 40:09.407
INCHEON AIRPORT

40:14.453 --> 40:17.039
Hey, good job. Did you sleep on the plane?

40:18.624 --> 40:21.168
Chi-seong, what day is it today?

40:21.252 --> 40:23.796
- It's Sunday, right?
- It's Saturday.

40:23.879 --> 40:25.965
Seriously? It isn't Sunday yet?

40:26.048 --> 40:28.676
What are you going to do on Sunday?
Why do you keep asking me that?

40:28.759 --> 40:31.137
My schedule's empty on Sunday, isn't it?

40:31.220 --> 40:33.180
Yeah, it's just as I said.

40:34.390 --> 40:37.435
- I'm going on a date.
- You mean…

40:37.518 --> 40:39.395
- The artist?
- Hmm.

40:39.478 --> 40:41.689
Are you really sure that it's a date?

40:42.648 --> 40:45.484
If a man and a woman meet alone,
it's a date.

40:45.568 --> 40:47.611
And we set up a date properly this time.

40:48.863 --> 40:51.407
All right. Just please
don't cause any trouble.

40:52.074 --> 40:53.117
And take care too.

40:53.200 --> 40:56.245
I'm not causing any trouble these days.
Don't worry about it.

41:00.124 --> 41:02.126
No, wait, he's probably sleeping now.

41:02.710 --> 41:04.545
- I'll just call later.
- Wait a sec.

41:05.588 --> 41:09.300
Were you really just being considerate
to another person right now?

41:11.594 --> 41:13.554
Oh, you're right.

41:14.430 --> 41:16.599
I didn't know I could actually do that.

41:17.141 --> 41:18.976
Looks like I've changed.

41:28.861 --> 41:30.196
Have some food.

41:32.865 --> 41:34.116
Hey, Ung.

41:37.077 --> 41:40.039
How can your repertoire
be exactly the same every time?

41:40.706 --> 41:42.416
That's honestly incredible.

41:45.211 --> 41:47.254
At least have one bite first.

41:48.422 --> 41:49.840
We can always talk while you eat.

41:50.883 --> 41:53.469
You always come and go
whenever you please.

41:53.552 --> 41:57.389
You don't have to try to act
like a mother to me, you know?

42:40.766 --> 42:42.560
What are you still doing here?

42:42.643 --> 42:43.894
Hey, you're finally up.

42:46.063 --> 42:47.690
You didn't sleep that much, you know.

42:47.773 --> 42:49.567
You'll die early at this rate.

42:49.650 --> 42:50.901
Hey, that shirt…

42:51.610 --> 42:54.321
Oh, I just took it
from your closet, that's all.

42:54.405 --> 42:56.198
I see you didn't throw it away.

42:57.032 --> 42:58.367
I didn't even know it was there.

42:58.450 --> 43:01.036
Oh, really? It was folded up
nice and neat, though.

43:01.620 --> 43:02.496
Oh.

43:02.580 --> 43:06.542
Do you feel awkward that I'm wearing
our couple shirt when we're friends now?

43:06.625 --> 43:08.210
Should I go change?

43:08.294 --> 43:09.878
Not at all. Do whatever you want.

43:10.462 --> 43:11.422
Mm-hmm.

43:11.505 --> 43:14.592
Oh. There were a lot of side dishes
in the fridge, so I made some stew for us.

43:14.675 --> 43:15.884
- Do you want any?
- Hey. Hey.

43:15.968 --> 43:18.596
It's my house,
my side dishes, my ingredients.

43:18.679 --> 43:20.431
What should we do after we eat?

43:20.514 --> 43:23.350
I can't be bothered to go out today.
You wanna play some games instead?

43:23.934 --> 43:25.394
You're not leaving?

43:25.477 --> 43:27.688
Why? Can't I stay longer? We're friends--

43:27.771 --> 43:29.773
Hey, you keep on saying
that we're "friends."

43:29.857 --> 43:31.317
What the hell is wrong with you?

43:31.400 --> 43:33.944
You want to be friends.
The best of friends. Don't you?

43:34.028 --> 43:36.363
- Hmm.
- All right, there you go.

43:36.447 --> 43:39.366
So let me hang out here as a friend.
That okay?

43:40.200 --> 43:42.911
All right, fine. Let's hang out all day.

44:13.442 --> 44:14.401
Hey, what's up?

44:14.485 --> 44:16.278
You have an interview today, remember?

44:16.362 --> 44:18.989
- I'll pick you up at two.
- Oh.

44:20.032 --> 44:22.368
Hey, could you cancel that for me?

44:22.451 --> 44:23.994
What? Why?

44:24.578 --> 44:26.538
Well, you know…

44:26.622 --> 44:28.832
I'm still not feeling that good.

44:28.916 --> 44:30.209
Are you still sick?

44:30.292 --> 44:31.877
I heard your fever went down.

44:31.960 --> 44:33.587
I'll just come over later then, okay?

44:33.671 --> 44:37.675
Oh, no, no, don't. Don't come over.
I'm going to sleep. Bye.

44:47.976 --> 44:48.977
Hey.

44:50.396 --> 44:54.650
Luckily, I don't have any plans today.
So I'll hang out with you.

44:54.733 --> 44:56.777
All right, buddy.

45:04.326 --> 45:05.160
Eating?

45:07.621 --> 45:09.415
I'll get some myself.

45:19.091 --> 45:21.593
Hey, Ji-ung. Didn't you go home yesterday?

45:21.677 --> 45:23.595
Wait, what are you doing here
on a weekend?

45:23.679 --> 45:26.765
Ah, I was helping Mr. Park
with a program he said he couldn't finish.

45:26.849 --> 45:29.435
Oh, why'd they contact you
without my permission?

45:29.518 --> 45:30.978
Don't do it. I'll talk to him.

45:31.061 --> 45:33.021
It's nothing much. I'll be done soon.

45:33.105 --> 45:36.525
Oh, yeah, I notified everyone that
we'll start filming again on Monday.

45:37.735 --> 45:40.362
And also,
I got a strange call a while ago.

45:40.446 --> 45:41.530
About what?

45:42.489 --> 45:44.950
I don't know
if what they said was true, but…

45:45.033 --> 45:45.868
What is it?

45:46.410 --> 45:49.204
They told me that
NJ wants to appear on our program.

45:49.288 --> 45:50.622
What? Who said that?

45:50.706 --> 45:52.291
Well, NJ herself.

45:53.542 --> 45:55.169
So she wants to appear as what?

45:55.252 --> 45:56.795
As Choi Ung's friend.

46:08.974 --> 46:11.268
I'm so stressed.

46:11.351 --> 46:13.812
So was that my third win or my fourth win?

46:13.896 --> 46:15.898
Why are you so good at this game anyway?

46:15.981 --> 46:18.525
Well, I guess it's harder to find
something I'm not good at.

46:18.609 --> 46:20.235
You're so annoying.

46:20.319 --> 46:22.029
Why don't you reflect
on your lack of skill

46:22.112 --> 46:23.906
instead of pinning the blame
on other people.

46:23.989 --> 46:25.949
We need to use our minds when playing too.

46:26.950 --> 46:28.410
Fine, just one more.

46:28.494 --> 46:30.579
Let's make it interesting.
Let's bet something.

46:30.662 --> 46:33.040
It won't be fun
if I just play with you for free.

46:33.123 --> 46:35.042
All right, what should we bet on then?

46:35.793 --> 46:37.753
Give me a drawing.

46:37.836 --> 46:40.005
Hey. Do you even know
how much one of them costs?

46:40.088 --> 46:42.466
You can win then.

46:43.217 --> 46:46.094
All right, hang on.
Let me just get more juice.

46:46.178 --> 46:47.304
Uh.

46:47.387 --> 46:49.139
Wait. Your phone's ringing.

46:49.223 --> 46:50.224
Probably Eun-ho.

46:55.020 --> 46:56.605
NJ

47:05.322 --> 47:08.992
I guess you're pretty close
to that girl, aren't you?

47:09.076 --> 47:11.286
- Who?
- That famous singer.

47:13.038 --> 47:14.122
NJ.

47:15.791 --> 47:16.917
Mm. Just a bit.

47:17.000 --> 47:18.752
Mm…

47:18.836 --> 47:20.587
You two seem to keep in touch,

47:20.671 --> 47:24.299
and she visits
even when she's really busy.

47:26.176 --> 47:29.263
Oh. So are you seeing each other?

47:29.763 --> 47:30.806
What?

47:30.889 --> 47:32.766
You're surprised? So are you?

47:33.851 --> 47:36.436
I mean, I was surprised
that you asked me that.

47:36.520 --> 47:39.314
Well, we're friends, aren't we?
Friends can ask stuff like that.

47:40.107 --> 47:43.443
Well, yeah, I guess so.
Since we're friends.

47:46.280 --> 47:48.031
Then let me ask you while we're at it.

47:48.907 --> 47:50.701
Is it true you were dating Mr. Jang?

47:51.743 --> 47:52.828
What?

47:52.911 --> 47:55.247
I can ask you that
since we're friends, right?

47:55.330 --> 47:57.749
We're just colleagues, nothing's going on.

47:58.417 --> 48:00.294
That's not what your other colleagues
seem to think.

48:00.377 --> 48:01.545
What do you mean?

48:02.671 --> 48:06.091
And speaking of,
since we're still on the topic now,

48:06.717 --> 48:08.969
how long have you been close to Ji-ung?

48:09.469 --> 48:10.304
Are you for real?

48:10.387 --> 48:12.264
You weren't that close to him back then.

48:12.347 --> 48:15.058
Wait… are you feeling jealous right now?

48:15.142 --> 48:16.810
- Yes.
- What?

48:16.894 --> 48:18.270
What?

48:25.944 --> 48:27.237
Um, I mean…

48:28.405 --> 48:31.199
don't steal Ji-ung away from me.
He's my friend too.

48:37.331 --> 48:38.832
NJ

48:40.459 --> 48:42.169
NJ

49:10.322 --> 49:11.198
Sol-i.

49:12.366 --> 49:15.285
If you take another step in here,
then I won't let you leave.

49:15.369 --> 49:17.412
You have to help me out with this.

49:18.622 --> 49:20.040
Hey, I was just passing by.

49:20.123 --> 49:22.084
You've been coming here
almost every single day.

49:22.167 --> 49:24.920
I know, right?
It's pretty here. And so is the owner.

49:25.003 --> 49:27.214
"And so is the owner."

49:27.297 --> 49:29.466
I already told you,
I don't date younger guys.

49:29.549 --> 49:32.719
Oh, you're serious? Well, thanks a lot!
You have to keep that promise!

49:32.803 --> 49:35.389
Hmm, why don't you come in for a minute?

49:35.472 --> 49:36.932
No, forget it. I'm not peeling onions.

49:37.015 --> 49:39.810
I'm going to peel something else too.
Come over here.

49:39.893 --> 49:42.479
- No can do. I gotta go.
- Where are you going?

49:42.562 --> 49:45.399
Hey. Stop bumming around
and go to work already.

49:45.482 --> 49:47.234
I was supposed to go to work today,

49:47.317 --> 49:49.236
but then Ung suddenly canceled on me.

49:49.903 --> 49:51.238
He said he's still sick,

49:51.321 --> 49:52.698
so I'm checking in on him.

49:54.408 --> 49:55.826
He told you he's sick?

49:55.909 --> 49:59.413
Yes. I know he said he was better,
but it looks like he's sick again.

50:00.080 --> 50:01.748
And he told me not to come.

50:01.832 --> 50:04.376
But still, as his manager,
I should check in on him.

50:04.459 --> 50:06.503
Wait. Don't. You shouldn't go there.

50:06.586 --> 50:07.838
Why?

50:07.921 --> 50:11.383
- Uh, I'm sure he has a guest.
- A guest? Who?

50:11.466 --> 50:14.011
Never mind.
Either way, you just shouldn't go.

50:14.094 --> 50:15.262
Just come over here.

50:15.345 --> 50:17.222
- Come on, stay with me today.
- I shouldn't.

50:17.305 --> 50:19.182
You promised me that you wouldn't do this.

50:19.683 --> 50:21.101
Forget it. I won't stay.

50:22.102 --> 50:24.646
Are you really going
to be a brat like that?

50:24.730 --> 50:27.149
Come over here while I'm being nice.
I'm good at throwing onions.

50:32.612 --> 50:35.198
- Are you leaving?
- Yes. Aren't you gonna go home?

50:35.282 --> 50:37.075
I'm gonna work a little more. You can go.

50:37.159 --> 50:38.160
All right.

50:43.957 --> 50:45.125
Is there anything else?

50:46.543 --> 50:48.378
Ji-ung, do…

50:51.173 --> 50:53.008
you want to get dinner?

50:56.511 --> 50:59.473
I mean, you have to eat
if you're going to keep working tonight,

50:59.556 --> 51:02.642
and I don't have much time
to eat at home, so I thought we'd eat out…

51:02.726 --> 51:03.810
Yeah, no problem.

51:04.352 --> 51:06.396
Why do you need to explain so much?
Let's eat.

51:08.982 --> 51:10.734
We could have eaten out, you know.

51:11.443 --> 51:14.613
Uh, no, it's fine.
You have to work right away anyway.

51:14.696 --> 51:15.655
All right, then.

51:21.244 --> 51:24.039
Stop staring at me like that, spit it out.

51:25.624 --> 51:27.793
Well, it's… I just…

51:29.753 --> 51:31.421
What? Are you okay?

51:31.505 --> 51:34.549
Do you wanna transfer?
Or are you thinking of quitting on me?

51:34.633 --> 51:37.636
Don't you dare. You don't
get to quit before I do, you hear me?

51:38.220 --> 51:40.764
No, it's not like that.

51:41.348 --> 51:42.516
Then what?

51:42.599 --> 51:45.477
Do you mind telling me
why you keep staring at me all the time?

51:46.186 --> 51:48.105
Do you have a crush on Ms. Kook?

51:52.234 --> 51:54.611
Oh, I'm so sorry.

51:54.694 --> 51:57.322
That was too personal for me to ask.

51:57.405 --> 51:59.699
I was just curious, that's all.

52:00.283 --> 52:01.118
I'm sorry.

52:02.160 --> 52:03.453
Well, if you're sorry…

52:05.747 --> 52:07.207
then keep this a secret.

52:07.791 --> 52:09.876
I've never told anyone about this.

52:16.967 --> 52:19.678
But was it really obvious?
I sure hope not.

52:20.887 --> 52:23.515
I only noticed because I watching
how you were around her.

52:23.598 --> 52:26.101
So wait, you weren't focusing
on our shots then?

52:26.184 --> 52:28.145
What a slacker.

52:35.193 --> 52:37.737
- It's pretty cheap, huh?
- What?

52:38.321 --> 52:40.031
Lying like this to my friend

52:40.115 --> 52:42.242
and having feelings for her in secret.

52:43.118 --> 52:45.745
You can't control
how you feel about people.

52:46.329 --> 52:47.998
So are you taking my side?

52:48.081 --> 52:50.542
I guess it's nice to have a junior.

52:53.461 --> 52:54.671
Don't worry.

52:54.754 --> 52:58.008
I'll plan to finish this project without
getting my personal feelings involved.

53:03.221 --> 53:05.515
Hey, I'm ordering chicken, okay?

53:05.599 --> 53:07.934
- What's that?
- I said, I'm going to order chicken.

53:08.018 --> 53:09.227
You're leaving?

53:27.746 --> 53:30.415
I shouldn't be spying
on other people's phones.

53:49.809 --> 53:51.186
But at the same time…

53:52.354 --> 53:55.190
I can't help it if I accidentally see it.

53:55.273 --> 53:56.608
And I keep my eyes closed.

53:58.068 --> 53:59.069
GU EUN-HO

54:00.946 --> 54:03.990
Ung, I rescheduled the interview
you canceled to next week.

54:04.074 --> 54:06.326
Hey, man, are you still
feeling sick or something?

54:06.409 --> 54:08.161
And are you sure I don't have to visit?

54:13.792 --> 54:15.919
He said he had no plans today.

54:16.503 --> 54:18.838
What in the world
is going through this guy's head?

54:36.231 --> 54:38.024
Did she really leave?

54:42.654 --> 54:44.531
SBC BROADCASTING

54:53.832 --> 54:55.542
I don't wanna go home tonight.

55:19.733 --> 55:22.777
Hey, I never said you could go
snooping around my house, you know.

55:55.185 --> 55:58.229
You can't do whatever you want
just because we're friends.

56:03.360 --> 56:04.736
So what's your plan?

56:05.820 --> 56:06.821
What?

56:06.905 --> 56:08.365
You were waiting until I came back

56:08.448 --> 56:10.700
so you could throw
salt and water on me, weren't you?

56:11.284 --> 56:12.702
You said
you'd film the documentary

56:12.786 --> 56:15.580
you yelled at me, bullied me,
hid and then reappeared.

56:16.247 --> 56:17.582
Then you kissed me.

56:18.750 --> 56:20.460
Now you want to be friends?

56:22.545 --> 56:24.756
I'm just curious about
what's going on in your head.

56:25.423 --> 56:26.758
I really want to know.

56:28.093 --> 56:29.844
I don't have any plans.

56:31.179 --> 56:34.307
I just wanna get along well with you.
What's the problem?

56:35.558 --> 56:36.684
But then…

56:41.356 --> 56:43.483
why do I feel
like you're lying to me right now?

56:50.824 --> 56:52.283
You're so self-centered, you know.

56:53.410 --> 56:55.578
There's something I want to hear from you.

56:56.079 --> 56:59.040
Come to think of it,
you never said it to me, not once.

57:00.208 --> 57:01.793
So I want to hear it now.

57:02.377 --> 57:03.920
We keep pretending to be friends.

57:05.088 --> 57:06.798
I'm going to make plans of my own.

57:08.842 --> 57:10.093
Oh, by the way…

57:11.344 --> 57:13.721
This one. It'll be my reward.

57:15.723 --> 57:19.978
Say is this the old amusement park
where we broke up for the fourth time?

57:21.396 --> 57:22.522
I can have this, right?

57:25.483 --> 57:26.860
Leave. You can't stay here tonight.

57:26.943 --> 57:29.028
"Tonight"? Then other nights are okay?

57:29.112 --> 57:31.406
You're really being weird right now.
You know that?

57:31.489 --> 57:32.574
I was about to go.

57:35.201 --> 57:36.578
After I eat the chicken.

57:46.463 --> 57:47.630
Is that the fried chicken?

57:47.714 --> 57:49.215
I'll be right there!

58:05.815 --> 58:07.817
What are you doing here so late?

58:10.236 --> 58:11.654
What about you two?

58:21.789 --> 58:24.125
Hello there. I'm Choi Ung's friend, NJ…

58:24.209 --> 58:25.627
EPILOGUE

58:25.710 --> 58:28.087
Can I use a fake name?
I didn't get permission yet.

58:28.171 --> 58:32.091
Or blur out my face?
No, wait. Then I'd look like a criminal.

58:32.675 --> 58:34.093
Let's just start filming.

58:35.762 --> 58:37.305
What would you like to know?

58:37.889 --> 58:39.557
Should I talk about Choi Ung then?

58:40.892 --> 58:42.435
It'll be so fun.

58:48.858 --> 58:51.444
Hey, you!
What's going on between you three?

58:53.363 --> 58:55.782
It looks like you guys got into a fight.

58:58.451 --> 59:05.458
JUST FRIENDS

59:27.480 --> 59:29.315
What are they up to?

59:30.024 --> 59:32.026
- I like it.
- What?

59:32.110 --> 59:35.321
You're not after some criminal.
You have a crush on him.

59:35.405 --> 59:36.823
Oh, Choi Ung!

59:40.702 --> 59:41.536
Yeon-su.

59:42.412 --> 59:44.872
Wait a minute. You wanna come up?

59:45.623 --> 59:47.792
I don't wanna
be friends with Ung.

59:47.875 --> 59:49.460
This is really bad.

59:50.086 --> 59:51.129
I guess I was wrong.

59:52.755 --> 59:54.340
I still have feelings for him.
